rem Billionaire
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=267
rem Find the best chance of reaching a
rem Goal from 1 in N flips of a fair
rem coin, staking a fixed fraction f
rem each time and winning twice it

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option N integer = 1000
option Goal integer = 1000000000

rem With h heads the fund is
rem (1 + 2 f)^h (1 - f)^(N - h). It is
rem largest at f = (3 h - N) / 2 N, and
rem the Goal is met by the least h whose
rem best fund reaches it. Then any
rem h or more heads win.
H = 0 to N array
Raw = (3 * H - N) / (2.0 * N)
F = (Raw 0.0 max) 0.999999 min
Win = (1 + 2 * F) log
Lose = (1 - F) log
Growth = H * Win + (N - H) * Lose
Target = Goal log
Need = Growth at least Target
Fits = H filter Need array
Least = Fits min
Tail = H filter (H at least Least) array
Ways = N Tail binomial
Wins = Ways sum
All = 2 ** N
Answer = Wins / All 12 round
Answer print
